        "cooked": "<p>Good.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Just got to this today, I did win on my first try, but that’s because I read this forum, and knew what was coming.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>In order, took&nbsp;out Anvil, Plague Rat, Hammer, Ermine and Proletariat was last. He had 1HP left after Scholar used Know when to Turn Loose....then bonehead Scholar used his power thinking the heroes would win, but Incapped himself instead. Oops! &nbsp;Anyway, an Amphibious Chupacabra showed up next and finished the job. &nbsp;Thanks, Wasteland!</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Stuntman 2HP, Legacy 7HP, Tachyon 8HP and short-attention-span&nbsp;Scholar 0HP.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
